Certifications/learning: CompTIA Network+/Security+, then OSCP or equivalent for practical offensive skills (for pros — ensure legal scope).


Lab practice (SAFE, legal): Use isolated virtual labs and intentionally vulnerable VMs (Metasploitable, DVWA, or custom isolated network). Don’t test on production or third-party networks. 🧪🔬


