1. HTTP/2 & HTTP/3 (QUIC) desync & parsing edge-cases

क्या: HTTP/2 framing और HTTP/1.1 proxies में parsing mismatch; QUIC का UDP+TLS अलग state.

ख़तरा: request smuggling, response desync, proxy confusion.

संकेत: proxy-origin mismatch, unexpected 4xx/5xx patterns, odd timings.

बचाव: canonical parsing chain, proxy + origin exact parsing tests, WAF जो HTTP/2 समझे.

लॉग: proxy raw logs, HTTP/2 frames, Zeek http2/quic metadata.



2. TLS 0-RTT / Replay & Session Resumption pitfalls

क्या: 0-RTT allows client data before handshake final — replayable.

ख़तरा: replay of idempotent transactions / payment replay.

संकेत: duplicate transactions with same client parameters; odd JA3 + identical session tickets.

बचाव: avoid 0-RTT for state-changing ops, use nonce/server-side replay protections.

लॉग: tls.log, JA3, session­ticket metadata.



3. Certificate Transparency / Misissued certificates & CT monitoring

क्या: CA compromise/misissued certs used for impersonation.

ख़तरा: silent MITM using rogue cert.

संकेत: unexpected certs for company domains in CT logs.

बचाव: CT monitoring, pinning for high-value services, OCSP stapling checks.

लॉग: CT alerts, tls cert details, OCSP responses.



4. JA3/JA3S fingerprints evasion and blending

क्या: TLS fingerprinting to detect malware; attackers can mimic benign clients.

ख़तरा: false negative if defender relies solely on JA3.

संकेत: JA3 benign + abnormal behavior (low volume, odd endpoints).

बचाव: combine JA3 with behavior (times, endpoints, DNS).

लॉग: JA3 + behavior baselines.



5. Compression side-channels (BREACH/CRIME-class)

क्या: compression leaks secrets via size differences.

ख़तरा: steal tokens inside compressed TLS responses.

संकेत: response size variance correlated with attacker controlled inputs.

बचाव: disable TLS-level compressions, separate secrets from attacker-controllable content.

लॉग: application response-size analytics.



6. HTTP header/proxy cache poisoning & cross-protocol caching

क्या: cache key poisoning or cross-protocol content caching.

ख़तरा: cached sensitive content returned to others, cache poison leading to XSS.

संकेत: cache hits for private URLs, unexpected Vary/Cache-Control headers.

बचाव: correct cache headers, CDN rules, purge & cache-key hygiene.

लॉग: CDN edge logs, proxy cache stats.



7. JWT / OAuth / OIDC misconfigurations & algorithm confusion

क्या: alg none, key reuse, weak signing keys, wrong audience/scopes.

ख़तरा: token forgery / privilege escalation.

संकेत: tokens with unusual alg, tokens re-used across apps.

बचाव: enforce alg whitelist, short lifetimes, audience checks, rotation.

लॉग: auth server logs, token introspection events.



8. SAML assertion replay / XML signature wrapping (WS-security style)

क्या: XML signature misplacement leads to assertion misuse.

ख़तरा: authentication bypass in SSO flows.

संकेत: unexpected Assertion Subjects, duplicate SAML assertions.

बचाव: strict XML parsing, signature validation bindings, audience restrictions.

लॉग: IdP logs, SAML transaction logs.



9. mTLS pitfalls (mutual TLS) — client cert handling

क्या: improper client cert mapping to identity, weak CA trust.

ख़तरा: client impersonation or authorization bypass.

संकेत: certs accepted from unexpected CAs, weak CN mapping.

बचाव: map cert to identity in backend, CRL/OCSP checks, pinning.

लॉग: TLS client cert details, OCSP hits.



10. DoH / DoT (DNS over HTTPS/TLS) bypassing enterprise DNS controls

क्या: encrypted DNS bypasses perimeter DNS logging.

ख़तरा: hidden DNS exfil/command-and-control.

संकेत: outbound HTTPS to known DoH endpoints from odd processes, SNI for DoH servers.

बचाव: block known DoH endpoints / force enterprise DoH, TLS SNI inspection, egress filtering.

लॉग: proxy TLS SNI, process network mapping.



11. DNSSEC pitfalls (NSEC/NSEC3 zone walking & key rollover errors)

क्या: zone walking vs privacy; rollover misconfig causes validation failures.

ख़तरा: validation failures → fail-open resolvers; attackers exploit.

संकेत: sudden validation failures for legit domains.

बचाव: test rollovers, prefer NSEC3+salt planning, monitor.

लॉग: resolver validation logs, DNSSEC failure alerts.



12. BGP short-lived hijacks & intercept windows

क्या: millisecond-to-minute hijacks capture traffic slices.

ख़तरा: intercept sessions, SSL/TLS MITM via renegotiation windows is hard but possible at scale.

संकेत: traceroute path churn, BGP update storms, sudden AS path changes.

बचाव: RPKI + immediate alerting, multi-path validation.

लॉग: BGP collectors, traceroute baselines.



13. IoT / Messaging protocols: MQTT, CoAP, AMQP, XMPP

क्या: lightweight protocols with weak auth in IoT/SCADA.

ख़तरा: device command takeover, lateral spread.

संकेत: anonymous CONNECTs, QoS abuse, unusual topics.

बचाव: auth, TLS, topic ACLs, broker hardening.

लॉग: broker auth logs, topic access logs.



14. VoIP / SIP / RTP (SRTP) issues

क्या: SIP auth/registration flaws, RTP interception.

ख़तरा: call interception, fraud, eavesdrop.

संकेत: odd SIP REGISTERs, RTP streams to unexpected endpoints.

बचाव: TLS for SIP (SIPS), SRTP, registrar hardening.

लॉग: SIP logs, RTP flow captures.



15. Kerberos edge cases (clock skew, SPN misconfig, delegation abuse — conceptual)

क्या: ticket replay, unconstrained delegation misuse.

ख़तरा: lateral movement using forged tickets (golden/silver ticket theory at high level).

संकेत: abnormal TGS requests, unusual service tickets.

बचाव: harden KDC, reduce privileges, monitor Kerberos log patterns.

लॉग: KDC logs, Windows security logs.



16. LLMNR / NBT-NS / WPAD & proxy auto-config risks

क्या: name resolution fallback protocols abused for credential capture.

ख़तरा: NTLM relay, WPAD-based proxy hijack.

संकेत: multicast name queries, unusual WPAD downloads.

बचाव: disable LLMNR/NBT-NS, secure WPAD deployment, force DNS.

लॉग: host name-service logs, proxy logs.



17. Protocol coercion / downgrade via middleboxes

क्या: middlebox rewriting causes downgrade (e.g., strip TLS SNI, change headers).

ख़तरा: invisible downgrade path to attacker.

संकेत: mismatch between client and server negotiated features.

बचाव: end-to-end integrity checks, monitor middlebox transformations.

लॉग: proxied vs origin logs diff.



18. Side-channels: timing, packet timing, size correlations

क्या: exfil via timing/size of protocol responses.

ख़तरा: stealthy low-bandwidth exfil that evades content inspection.

संकेत: periodic micro-variations, unusual inter-packet timing patterns.

बचाव: entropy/time-pattern detection, rate shaping, egress policy.

लॉग: fine-grain flow timestamps, time-series analytics.



19. Protocol FSM (finite state machine) fuzzing discovery — theory

क्या: implementing malformed state transitions to elicit undefined behavior.

ख़तरा: crashes, logic bypasses in protocol stacks.

संकेत: service crashes, restarts, memory faults.

बचाव: robust parsing libs, fuzz testing in CI.

लॉग: service crash logs, core dumps (lab only).



20. Cross-protocol & protocol confusion attacks

क्या: send one protocol to a service expecting another (e.g., HTTP to SMTP port) to trigger mis-interpretation.

ख़तरा: provoke admin creds or cause app bugs.

संकेत: service errors, unusual logs.

बचाव: strict service binding, firewall by application.

लॉग: service error logs.





