4) Detection & Telemetry — क्या लॉग/मैट्रिक्स रखना चाहिए (SIEM/NSM playbook) 🧾

Network: NetFlow/IPFIX, sFlow, Zeek logs (conn, dns, http, ssl), switch logs (MAC table, errdisable), DHCP server logs.

Endpoints: EDR alerts, ARP table snapshots, route table changes.

Cloud: VPC flow logs, CloudTrail/CloudWatch, IAM usage logs, metadata access logs.

Retention & Forensics: PCAP retention for critical segments (30–90d), hashed artifact storage, time sync (NTP), chain-of-custody.

Correlation rules to prioritize: MAC churn + new switch port active → alert; BGP origin change + traffic shift → escalate; Egress DNS tunnelling patterns → hunt.



