6) Lab Blueprint — अपना पैक (isolated, safe) 🧪

Hardware/VMs: managed switch (virtual or physical), router (virtual), DHCP/DNS servers, Windows/Linux hosts, IDS host (Suricata/Zeek), SIEM (ELK/Splunk), cloud sandbox account.
Scenarios to practice (lab only): subnet misconfig, trunk misconfig, VPN split vs full tunnel, rogue DHCP (lab), IPv6 unwanted traffic, BGP toy lab using FRRouting/quagga.
Tools (learn-only list): Zeek, Suricata, Wireshark, tcpdump, NetFlow collectors, testssl.sh, test labs: TryHackMe/HTB/OffSec.
Note: किसी भी attack simulation को केवल अपने लैब में और लिखित RoE के साथ ही करें।


