7) Pentester Evidence Kit — क्या-क्या capture करें (industry-ready) 📁

PCAPs (hash + timestamp) for relevant windows.

NetFlow/Zeek logs, switch MAC dumps, router BGP/OSPF state, firewall ACL snapshots.

Cloud logs: VPC flow, CloudTrail; IAM logs.

Photographs of physical access points, patch panels, tamper evidence.

Chain-of-custody document, artifact hashes (SHA256), witness & signatures.



