8) Report Structure — एक परफेक्ट Pentest Finding (copy-ready) 📝

1. Title & Severity (CVE-like severity mapping)


2. Executive summary (1–2 lines) — business impact


3. Technical detail (conceptual evidence) — logs, hashes, screenshots (no raw creds)


4. Indicators (IOCs) — IPs, MACs, rule IDs, log snippets


5. Risk & Attack Scenario (high-level) — what could happen if exploited


6. Immediate remediation (0–24h) — containment steps


7. Short/Medium/Long term remediation (7/30/90d) — actionable plan


8. Appendices: lab notes, artifacts, chain-of-custody




