9) 30/60/90 Remediation Plan (नेटवर्क-फर्स्ट) ⏱️

0–24h: isolate exposed mgmt, disable unused ports, block public access to BMC/IPMI, freeze changes in impacted segments.

7 days: port-security, DHCP snooping, disable DTP, inventory + lock patch panels, enable NetFlow/Zeek for critical VLANs.

30 days: implement BGP filtering/RPKI, move mgmt behind bastion w/ MFA, enable OTDR baselines for fiber critical links.

90 days: micro-segmentation of critical assets, purple-team to validate detection rules, supplier/hardware provenance checks.



